'''Master Da Xun''' (マスターダッフン masutaa daffun, ''Lit. '''Master Dagshund''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.5 Update|Version 2.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Master Da Xun
|image = E 110.png
|first appearance = [[Escaping the Home]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 15|Infernal Tower - Floor 15]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
While he might seem ripped, don't let that frighten you. He has much more health than [[Dagshund]], but slightly weaker attack power combined with a slower attack rate. He also has three knockbacks instead of Dagshund's one knockback. Due to his health, his usage in most of the stages he appears in is to act as a meatshield for more threatening enemies, such as [[The Red Malice]] or [[Hermit Peng]].

